#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:14
msgid "Project Defaults"
msgstr "Predvolené nastavenia projektu"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:16
msgid ""
"Kdenlive uses these settings for creating a new project (see Menu > File > "
"New, or when Kdenlive starts and the option for opening the last project is "
"not checked). To change the parameters for a currently open project, use "
"the :doc:`Project Settings </project_and_asset_management/"
"project_settings>`. Please note that while changing parameter for the open "
"project is possible, it is not recommended as it may break things like "
"keyframes and cuts."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive používa tieto nastavenia na vytvorenie nového projektu (pozri "
"Ponuka > Súbor > Nový, alebo keď sa Kdenlive spustí a možnosť otvorenia "
"posledného projektu nie je zaškrtnutá). Ak chcete zmeniť parametre aktuálne "
"otvoreného projektu, použite :doc:`Nastavenia projektu</"
"project_and_asset_management/project_settings>`. Upozorňujeme, že hoci zmena "
"parametrov otvoreného projektu je možná, neodporúča sa, pretože môže narušiť "
"veci ako kľúčové snímky a strihové body."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:22
msgid "The Project Defaults section"
msgstr "Časť Predvolené nastavenia projektu"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Project Folder`. This is an important setting for keeping your "
"projects organized and your file system shipshape. Kdenlive creates the "
"following folders for each project: :file:`audiothumbs`, :file:`sequences`, :"
"file:`videothumbs`, and :file:`workfiles`. See also :doc:`/getting_started/"
"configure_kdenlive/configuration_info`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Priečinok projektu`. Toto je dôležité nastavenie pre udržiavanie "
"vašich projektov organizovaných a súborového systému v poriadku. Kdenlive "
"vytvára nasledujúce priečinky pre každý projekt: :file:`audiothumbs`, :file:"
"`sequences`, :file:`videothumbs` a :file:`workfiles`. Pozrite si tiež :doc:`/"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_info`."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:26
msgid ""
"If set to :guilabel:`Default`, Kdenlive will create these folders in a "
"special folder in the installation path. For Linux this is :file:`/home/"
"<username>/.var/app/org.kde.kdenlive/cache/kdenlive/<projectID>/`. For "
"Windows this is :file:`%APPDATA\\\\Local\\\\kdenlive\\\\cache`."
msgstr ""
"Ak je nastavené na :guilabel:`Predvolené`, Kdenlive vytvorí tieto priečinky "
"v špeciálnom priečinku v inštalačnej ceste. Pre Linux je to :file:`/home/"
"<username>/.var/app/org.kde.kdenlive/cache/kdenlive/<projectID>/`. Pre "
"Windows je to :file:`%APPDATA\\\\Local\\\\kdenlive\\\\cache`."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Parent folder of project file`. If this is selected, Kdenlive "
"will create the folders for the project in the parent folder of the project "
"file. For example, if your project file is in :file:`/home/my/projects/"
"project_1/`, Kdenlive will create project related files in :file:`../"
"project_1/`: :file:`/home/my/projects/project_1/audiothumbs/`, :file:`/home/"
"my/projects/project_1/sequences/`, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nadradený priečinok súboru projektu`. Ak je toto vybraté, "
"Kdenlive vytvorí priečinky pre projekt v nadradenom priečinku súboru "
"projektu. Napríklad, ak sa váš súbor projektu nachádza v :file:`/home/my/"
"projects/project_1/`, Kdenlive vytvorí súbory súvisiace s projektom v :file:"
"`../project_1/`: :file:`/home/my/projects/project_1/audiothumbs/`, :file:`/"
"home/my/projects/project_1/sequences/` atď."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom project folder`: You can specify a folder to use for these "
"project folders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vlastný priečinok projektu`: Môžete zadať priečinok, ktorý sa "
"použije pre tieto priečinky projektu."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Select the Default Profile (preset)`. In this section you define "
"which of the profiles to be used when creating a new project. Use the "
"filters for :guilabel:`Fps` and :guilabel:`Scanning` (the old fashioned "
"reference to :term:`interlaced` or :term:`progressive`). You can create a "
"new profile from here by clicking on |configure|\\ :guilabel:`Manage project "
"profiles` icon. For details about how to do that, please see :ref:`Project "
"Profiles / Preset <project_profile>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vyberte predvolený profil (prednastavenie)`. V tejto časti "
"definujete, ktorý z profilov sa použije pri vytváraní nového projektu. "
"Použite filtre pre :guilabel:`Fps` a :guilabel:`Skenovanie` (starý odkaz na :"
"term:`prekladané<interlaced>` alebo :term:`progresívne<progressive>`). Nový "
"profil môžete vytvoriť odtiaľto kliknutím na ikonu |configure|\\ :guilabel:"
"`Spravovať profily projektu`. Podrobnosti o tom nájdete v :ref:`Profily/"
"prednastavenia projektu <project_profile>`."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Video/Audio Tracks`. Determines the number of video and tracks a "
"new project has. You can add and delete tracks later at any time."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Video/zvukové stopy`. Určuje počet video stôp a stôp, ktoré má "
"nový projekt. Stopy môžete kedykoľvek neskôr pridávať a odstraňovať."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Audio channels`. Determines how many channels each audio track "
"supports. Options are **2 channels (stereo)** (default), **4 channels**, and "
"**6 channels**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zvukové kanály`. Určuje, koľko kanálov každá zvuková stopa "
"podporuje. Možnosti sú **2 kanály (stereo)** (predvolené), **4 kanály** a "
"**6 kanálov**."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_project_defaults.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timeline Preview profile`. Select which encoding profile to use "
"for the :doc:`Preview Render </tips_and_tricks/tips_and_tricks/"
"timeline_preview_rendering>` function. The available options depend on your "
"HW and installed codecs. You can manage the profiles by clicking on the |"
"configure|\\ :guilabel:`Show profile parameters` icon. To see the profile "
"parameters in the text window below the profile selection field, click on "
"the |help-about| icon."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Profil náhľadu časovej osi`. Vyberte, ktorý kódovací profil sa má "
"použiť pre funkciu :doc:`Renderovanie náhľadu</tips_and_tricks/"
"tips_and_tricks/timeline_preview_rendering>`. Dostupné možnosti závisí od "
"vášho HW a nainštalovaných kodekov. Profily môžete spravovať kliknutím na "
"ikonu |configure|\\ :guilabel:`Zobraziť parametre profilu`. Ak chcete "
"zobraziť parametre profilu v textovom okne pod poľom výberu profilu, "
"kliknite na ikonu |help-about|."

